5. WIRING — the eight canonical fields in order, ending with the violation scope, and the
   Phase-2 deferral names a STRUCTURAL signal (consecutive records on one lease id paired
   against the holder field), so it books enforcement that can actually arrive.

SHARED FURNITURE — NOT SCOREABLE. The frontmatter, the entire MUST NOT section including its
